      "status": "not-found",
      "chapters": []
    },
    {
      "characterId": "ming_yan",
      "quoteIndex": 0,
      "text": "我知道二爷想要什么，我去弄来便是。",
      "sourceId": "liaoping-xinjiao",
      "status": "not-found",
      "chapters": []
    },
    {
      "characterId": "miaoyu",
      "quoteIndex": 0,
      "text": "古人自汉晋五代唐宋以来，皆无好诗，只有两句好：纵有千年铁门槛，终须一个土馒头。",
      "sourceId": "liaoping-xinjiao",
      "status": "not-found",
      "chapters": []
    },
    {
      "characterId": "miaoyu",
      "quoteIndex": 1,
      "text": "槛外人妙玉恭肃遥叩芳辰。",
      "sourceId": "liaoping-xinjiao",
      "status": "match",
      "chapters": [
        63
      ]
    },
    {
      "characterId": "miaoyu",
      "quoteIndex": 2,
      "text": "你这么个人，竟是大俗人，连水也尝不出来。",
      "sourceId": "liaoping-xinjiao",
      "status": "match",
      "chapters": [
        41
      ]
    },
    {
      "characterId": "lai_tou_heshang",
      "quoteIndex": 0,
      "text": "好防佳节元宵后，便是烟消火灭时。",
      "sourceId": "liaoping-xinjiao",
      "status": "match",
      "chapters": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "characterId": "bo_zu_daoren",
      "quoteIndex": 0,
      "text": "世人都晓神仙好，只有娇妻忘不了。君生日日说恩情，君死又随人去了。",
      "sourceId": "liaoping-xinjiao",
      "status": "not-found",
      "chapters": []
    },
    {
      "characterId": "ma_daopo",
      "quoteIndex": 0,
      "text": "只要舍得银子，没有不灵的。",
      "sourceId": "liaoping-xinjiao",
      "status": "not-found",
      "chapters": []
    },
    {
      "characterId": "liu_laolao",
      "quoteIndex": 0,
      "text": "老刘老刘，食量大如牛，吃个老母猪不抬头。",
      "sourceId": "liaoping-xinjiao",
      "status": "not-found",
      "chapters": []
    },
    {
      "characterId": "jia_yucun",
      "quoteIndex": 0,
      "text": "玉在椟中求善价，钗于奁内待时飞。",
      "sourceId": "liaoping-xinjiao",
      "status": "not-found",
      "chapters": []
    },
    {
      "characterId": "liu_xianglian",
      "quoteIndex": 0,
      "text": "大丈夫一言既出，驷马难追。",
      "sourceId": "liaoping-xinjiao",
      "status": "not-found",
      "chapters": []
    },
    {
      "characterId": "liu_xianglian",
      "quoteIndex": 1,
      "text": "你们东府里除了那两个石头狮子干净，只怕连猫儿狗儿都不干净。",
      "sourceId": "liaoping-xinjiao",
      "status": "match",
      "chapters": [
        66
      ]
    },
    {
      "characterId": "jiang_yuhan",
      "quoteIndex": 0,
      "text": "多承公子错爱，愧不敢当。",
      "sourceId": "liaoping-xinjiao",
      "status": "not-found",
      "chapters": []
    },
    {
      "characterId": "you_erjie",
      "quoteIndex": 0,
      "text": "我如今是一心一意服侍你的，再不敢有二心了。",
      "sourceId": "liaoping-xinjiao",
      "status": "not-found",
      "chapters": []
    },
    {
      "characterId": "you_erjie",
      "quoteIndex": 1,
      "text": "倒不如一死，倒还干净。",
      "sourceId": "liaoping-xinjiao",
      "status": "not-found",
      "chapters": []
    },
    {
      "characterId": "qin_ye",
      "quoteIndex": 0,
      "text": "我这女儿，与贾府有些瓜葛。",
      "sourceId": "liaoping-xinjiao",
      "status": "not-found",
      "chapters": []
    },
    {
      "characterId": "bei_jing_wang",
      "quoteIndex": 0,
      "text": "令郎真乃龙驹凤雏，非小王在贵人前唐突，将来'雏凤清于老凤声'，未可量也。",
      "sourceId": "liaoping-xinjiao",
      "status": "not-found",
      "chapters": []
    },
    {
      "characterId": "zhao_yiniang",
      "quoteIndex": 0,
      "text": "正经叫你那宝贝去！叫他替你出气！",
      "sourceId": "liaoping-xinjiao",
      "status": "not-found",
      "chapters": []
    },
    {
      "characterId": "jia_dairu",
      "quoteIndex": 0,
      "text": "那瑞大爷也该打，哄我说是婶子叫他去呢。",
      "sourceId": "liaoping-xinjiao",
      "status": "not-found",
      "chapters": []
    },
    {
      "characterId": "jia_yun",
      "quoteIndex": 0,
      "text": "舅舅说得有理，只是我也没办法。求舅舅借我些银子，改日加倍奉还。",
      "sourceId": "liaoping-xinjiao",
      "status": "not-found",
      "chapters": []
    },
    {
      "characterId": "jia_zhu",
      "quoteIndex": 0,
      "text": "这孩子读书很用心，日后必有出息。",
      "sourceId": "liaoping-xinjiao",
      "status": "not-found",
      "chapters": []
    },
    {
      "characterId": "xing_xiuyan",
      "quoteIndex": 0,
      "text": "浓淡由他冰雪中。",
      "sourceId": "liaoping-xinjiao",
      "status": "match",
      "chapters": [
        50
      ]
    },
    {
      "characterId": "sun_shaozu",
      "quoteIndex": 0,
      "text": "你老子使了我五千银子，把你准折卖给我的。",
      "sourceId": "liaoping-xinjiao",
      "status": "not-found",
      "chapters": []
    },
    {
      "characterId": "sun_shaozu",
      "quoteIndex": 1,
      "text": "好不好，打一顿撵在下房里睡去。",
      "sourceId": "liaoping-xinjiao",
      "status": "match",
      "chapters": [
        80
      ]
    },
    {
      "characterId": "zhui_er",
      "quoteIndex": 0,
      "text": "坠儿不敢，坠儿再也不敢了。",
      "sourceId": "liaoping-xinjiao",
      "status": "not-found",
      "chapters": []
    },
    {
      "characterId": "si_er",
      "quoteIndex": 0,
      "text": "二爷待我极好的。",
      "sourceId": "liaoping-xinjiao",
      "status": "not-found",
      "chapters": []
    },
    {
      "characterId": "he_popo",
      "quoteIndex": 0,
      "text": "这园子里的事，我都知道。",
      "sourceId": "liaoping-xinjiao",
      "status": "not-found",
      "chapters": []
    },
    {
      "characterId": "bu_shiren",
      "quoteIndex": 0,
      "text": "我的儿，你舅母也没说什么，只是你姨娘说道：'你又没有事情，借了银子做什么？'",
      "sourceId": "liaoping-xinjiao",
      "status": "not-found",
      "chapters": []
    },
    {
      "characterId": "ni_er",
      "quoteIndex": 0,
      "text": "罢了，你也不用说了，银子我借给你！",
      "sourceId": "liaoping-xinjiao",
      "status": "not-found",
      "chapters": []
    },
    {
      "characterId": "wei_ruolan",
      "quoteIndex": 0,
      "text": "湘云是个豪爽人，我极敬重她。",
      "sourceId": "liaoping-xinjiao",
      "status": "not-found",
      "chapters": []
    },
    {
      "characterId": "jia_hui",
      "quoteIndex": 0,
      "text": "林姑娘待我极好。",
      "sourceId": "liaoping-xinjiao",
      "status": "not-found",
      "chapters": []
    },
    {
      "characterId": "lai_shangrong",
      "quoteIndex": 0,
      "text": "借主子的恩典，我也做了官了。",
      "sourceId": "liaoping-xinjiao",
      "status": "not-found",
      "chapters": []
    },
    {
      "characterId": "hu_yongyi",
      "quoteIndex": 0,
      "text": "这药吃下去，保准见效。",
      "sourceId": "liaoping-xinjiao",
      "status": "not-found",
      "chapters": []
    },
    {
      "characterId": "bao_chan",
      "quoteIndex": 0,
      "text": "奶奶要什么，我都依你。",
      "sourceId": "liaoping-xinjiao",
      "status": "not-found",
      "chapters": []
    },
    {
      "characterId": "wu_er",
      "quoteIndex": 0,
      "text": "冤枉啊，那玫瑰露真不是我偷的。",
      "sourceId": "liaoping-xinjiao",
      "status": "not-found",
      "chapters": []
    },
    {
      "characterId": "qiutong",
      "quoteIndex": 0,
      "text": "老爷赏我给二爷做妾，我好歹也是个主子。",
      "sourceId": "liaoping-xinjiao",
      "status": "not-found",
      "chapters": []
    },
    {
      "characterId": "diguan",
      "quoteIndex": 0,
      "text": "藕官待我极好的。",
      "sourceId": "liaoping-xinjiao",
      "status": "not-found",
      "chapters": []
    },
    {
      "characterId": "zhen_yingjia",
      "quoteIndex": 0,
      "text": "甄贾两家本是同宗。",
      "sourceId": "liaoping-xinjiao",
      "status": "not-found",
      "chapters": []
    },
    {
      "characterId": "wu_jinxiao",
      "quoteIndex": 0,
      "text": "今年收成不好，请主子宽限几日。",
      "sourceId": "liaoping-xinjiao",
      "status": "not-found",
      "chapters": []
    },
    {
